  "Name": "eZip Wizard 3.0 Stack Buffer Overflow",
  "Description": "This module exploits a stack-based buffer overflow vulnerability in version 3.0 of ediSys Corp.'s eZip Wizard. In order for the command to be executed, an attacker must convince someone to open a specially crafted zip file with eZip Wizard, and access the specially file via double-clicking it. By doing so, an attacker can execute arbitrary code as the victim user.",
